# src/apps/android/app/src/androidTest/java/com/luminet

## Purpose
Scopes Android instrumentation tests to the LumiNet application namespace.

## Contents
Contains the nested `android` instrumentation-test package and related device-facing test code.

## Interfaces and dependencies
Compiled by the Android test source set and linked to application/runtime contracts through test dependencies.

## Invariants
Namespace structure must match package declarations; this tree is test-only and may exercise production APIs but must not provide production replacements.